<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Listing is Live – Kaban</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: #f8f9fa;
      color: #7A7A7A;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .header {
      background: #28a745;
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .content {
      padding: 40px 30px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #28a745;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 32px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    .footer {
      background: #f8f9fa;
      padding: 30px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #54595F;
      border-top: 1px solid #e9ecef;
    }

    .footer a {
      color: #437EF7;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Your Listing is Live!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Hello,</p>
      <p>Great news! Your listing <strong>"{{listingTitle}}"</strong> has been approved and is now live on Kaban.</p>
      <p>Your listing will expire 30 days after its publication date.</p>

      <p style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{viewUrl}}" class="button">View Your Live Listing</a>
      </p>

      <p>Start receiving inquiries and close deals faster. Thank you for trusting Kaban with your real estate journey.
      </p>
      <p>Best regards,<br>The Kaban Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      Kaban.ng | …real estate at your convenience!<br>
      <a href="https://kaban.ng/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> •
      <a href="https://kaban.ng/terms-of-service">Terms of Service</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>